{"reviews":[{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-0","r":3.0,"t":"Solo para abundante cabellos, largosss y gruesos","x":"Funciona bien, pero solo en cabellos muy largos y abundantes, tienes que tener bastante cabellos y gruesos, es inc\u00f3modo de trabajar","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-1","r":1.0,"t":"Too big!","x":"This item is just too big. It makes it difficult to use.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-2","r":2.0,"t":"came broken. doesn't hold a wave","x":"I have been using Bed Head hair waver for a while now and thought i would give this a shot. The clamp clip was missing and has exposed hot metal when trying to use. the first time my hair looked great, but after that it does not keep the waves. My hair holds curls/waves very well so this was a disappointment. The position of the On/Off switch is right under the clamp so i kept turning of the waver mid use.  Depending on your hair type and your budget i would recommend spending a little more and ","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-3","r":5.0,"t":"Must buy","x":"Bought for my 9 year old for Christmas as she loves to have her hair braided solely for the waves that Come when she takes them out! I love the heat globe that it comes with to keep her safe and the carrying storage bag is beautiful. It heats up super quick and did an amazing job. I love the different heat settings as I have thin hair but my daughter has super thick hair.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-4","r":3.0,"t":"Makes my hair smell!","x":"My hair is naturally wavy so I thought that it would hold well, could be user error but doesn\u2019t hold well\u2026 I use the same heat shield as I do with all my other hot tools and my hair doesn\u2019t smell but this just makes my hair smell burnt! (So strongly it makes my pillow stink and others can smell it)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great curling Iron for the price","x":"Very easy to use. Curling iron heats up very quick and has cool touch tip so you're less likely to burn yourself. I like that I can adjust the temperature so that I can use on my young daughters hair as well. Very good quality and comes with heat glove as well as storage bag.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-6","r":5.0,"t":"Super cute product!","x":"I was searching for a great waver online, looked a lot of options that were available but I loved the customer reviews, the color and design of this product and also the fact that we got a protective heat glove and a cover pouch for safe keeping of the product!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-7","r":5.0,"t":"Love!","x":"I\u2019m so impressed with it!! This was exactly what my daughter and I wanted and we tried it the second it was delivered. Our waves turned out beautiful! It\u2019s so easy to use and the glove is fantastic! Love it love it love it!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-8","r":4.0,"t":"I need it to get hotter.","x":"My daughter likes it. It does not get hot enough for me to love it. I need it to be at least 400\u2070F. We both have thick healthy hair. The wave does not last. It would probably work best on thinner finer hair.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-9","r":5.0,"t":"Hair curler","x":"So far I have like the product it is easy to use. The glove allows you to not burn your hand. I like that there is a temperature adjustment setting. The barrel size is perfect. Overall it is a good product","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-10","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to use","x":"This iron makes achieving casual waves so simple! I am terrible at doing my hair- have no idea what I\u2019m doing and was still very happy with my result after using this iron. If I can do it, anyone can!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-11","r":1.0,"t":"Broken","x":"It was broken if u see the clip is separated i tried clipping it back together but the screws are tooo small to attach it back. Very disapointed. I will be returning this","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-12","r":5.0,"t":"Great","x":"The design is sheek and flawless. The fast heating capability is nice. I love the carrying case and heat glove to keep everything from getting burnt including my hands!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-13","r":5.0,"t":"I love it","x":"I love the color and how hot it got so fast. I\u2019m loving my waves and they are holding with no spray. I have thick brown African American hair and it held up so good.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-14","r":4.0,"t":"My old one seemed to be opposite this","x":"Cute, seems like it\u2019s opposite the one I used to have so will have to get used to it, wanted one for a while though. Got a great deal and am so excited to use it","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-15","r":5.0,"t":"Works great!","x":"This is very easy to use and works well. I have very straight hair and even tho it was still slightly damp when I used it, I still had wavy hair the next day.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-16","r":5.0,"t":"My wife loves it.","x":"My wife loves this 3 barrel iron. She says it is easy to use and really like the ability to adjust the temperature to what works with her hair. Great product","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-17","r":1.0,"t":"Broke when arrived","x":"I was so excited about getting this but when it arrived it wouldn\u2019t even turn on. Not sure if I just got a bad one or if anyone else has had this problem.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-18","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"Such a good product, makes my hair look fabulous and I have so many compliments on my hair when I use this product. Easy to use and holds hair so good!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-19","r":5.0,"t":"Easy and fast to use.","x":"I really liked this product. It is easy to use, however I recommend using heat protectant. It can easily burn your hair if you leave it for too long","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-20","r":5.0,"t":"Works awesome!!","x":"Definitely a must have in ur hot tools. I love how it gives me that look without spending the hours it takes to achieve!! Definitely would buy again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-21","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"Styles easy, heats up quickly, cleans well and is just like the top of the line products for a fraction of the price. Definitely recommend.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-22","r":5.0,"t":"well worth it!!","x":"this is a very good crimper. It gets nice and hot they supply you with the glove and a heat bag!!Definitely recommend this","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-23","r":5.0,"t":"I hope my granddaughter likes it, and will use it easily.","x":"My granddaughter,  is the one going to use it.  We had our Christmas on New Year's day, so not sure how she likes it, yet.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08LVVTVF5-24","r":5.0,"t":"Gets the job done fast!","x":"Great when you're in a hurry.  Gets hot super fast so no more waiting for it to get hot. Leaves hair looking perfect!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the waver easy to use and effective at creating waves, even for those who struggle with hair styling.","cites":[6,8,10,11,14]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the included heat glove and storage bag/carrying case as useful safety and convenience accessories.","cites":[4,6,7,8,10,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers highlight fast heating and adjustable temperature settings as positives.","cites":[4,6,10,13,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the waves do not hold or last, especially on thick or healthy hair, and note it may work better on thinner/finer hair.","cites":[3,5,9]},{"text":"A few reviewers report quality problems such as arriving broken or missing the clamp clip, and some find the tool too big or awkward to work with.","cites":[1,2,3,12]}]},"qa":[]}